      {
        "name": "group",
        "label": "Group",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": "Battery PDM",
        "query": "groups",
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": "All",
        "current": {
          "selected": true,
          "text": "All",
          "value": "All"
        },
        "refresh": 1
      },
      {
        "name": "cell",
        "label": "Cell",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": "Battery PDM",
        "query": "cells:$group",
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": "All",
        "current": {
          "selected": true,
          "text": "All",
          "value": "All"
        },
        "refresh": 1
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Model Training & Evaluation Protocol",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 3
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Protocol: Trained on vs. Tested on\n\n- **Model**: `soh_xgb_demo` (saved as portable XGBoost booster `soh_xgb_demo.ubj` + `soh_xgb_demo.json`)\n- **Trained on**: Cell **B0006** - held out from the demo replay\n- **Tested on (live replay)**: **B0005**, **B0007**, **B0018** (replayed as a 3-cell series pack)\n- **Evaluation**: leave-one-cell-out. Held-out error, the Coulomb baseline and the constant-mean baseline are read from the database into the **Model Summary** panel below.\n- **Retirement threshold**: 80% SOH (discharge-index count, not raw cycles)"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Latest SOH",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 3,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "target": "table:stat_latest_soh",
          "type": "table",
          "datasource": "Battery PDM"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 80
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 90
              }
            ]
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          }
        }
      }
